# Safe Component

HTTP client for interacting with the Safe Transaction Service API to monitor multi-signature wallet transactions.

## Key Integration Pattern
Chain-aware API client that tracks queued Safe transactions requiring additional signatures, with comprehensive Prometheus metrics instrumentation.

## Important Constraints
- Chain ID must be set before any API requests (thread-safe via mutex)
- No built-in retry logic - resilience handled by higher layers
- Verify transaction signers match actual Safe owners using case-insensitive comparison